{
  "defaults": {
    "cfg": 1,
    "denoise": 1,
    "megapixels": 1,
    "sampler_name": "euler",
    "scheduler": "simple",
    "steps": 10
  },
  "description": "Instruction-based image editing with Krea-2 Turbo and the Krea-2 Identity Edit LoRA (requires the comfyui-krea2edit nodes)",
  "groups": [{
    "id": 1,
    "member_nodes": ["1", "note:1"],
    "title": "Diffusion Model"
  }, {
    "id": 2,
    "member_nodes": ["2", "note:2"],
    "title": "Identity Edit LoRA"
  }, {
    "id": 3,
    "member_nodes": ["3", "note:3"],
    "title": "CLIP Configuration"
  }, {
    "id": 4,
    "member_nodes": ["4", "note:4"],
    "title": "VAE Configuration"
  }, {
    "id": 5,
    "member_nodes": ["10", "11", "note:5"],
    "title": "Edit Configuration"
  }, {
    "id": 6,
    "member_nodes": ["13", "note:6"],
    "title": "Sampling Configuration"
  }],
  "name": "Krea-2 Edit (Identity Edit LoRA)",
  "nodes": {
    "1": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Load Diffusion Model"
      },
      "class_type": "UNETLoader",
      "inputs": {
        "unet_name": "unet.safetensors",
        "weight_dtype": "default"
      }
    },
    "10": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Edit Model Patch"
      },
      "class_type": "Krea2EditModelPatch",
      "inputs": {
        "fit_mode": "fit",
        "model": ["2", 0],
        "ref_boost": 4,
        "ref_boost_a": 1,
        "source_image": ["6", 0],
        "source_latent": ["9", 0],
        "target_latent": ["8", 0],
        "vae": ["4", 0]
      }
    },
    "100": {
      "class_type": "LoraLoaderModelOnly",
      "inputs": {
        "lora_name": "main_lora.safetensors",
        "model": ["1", 0],
        "strength_model": 0.800000011920929
      }
    },
    "11": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Edit Instruction"
      },
      "class_type": "Krea2EditGroundedEncode",
      "inputs": {
        "clip": ["3", 0],
        "grounding_px": 768,
        "image": ["6", 0],
        "prompt": "A \"red\" fox\nin snow \\ test",
        "system_prompt": ""
      }
    },
    "12": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Empty Negative"
      },
      "class_type": "Krea2EditGroundedEncode",
      "inputs": {
        "clip": ["3", 0],
        "grounding_px": 768,
        "image": ["6", 0],
        "prompt": "",
        "system_prompt": ""
      }
    },
    "13": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "KSampler"
      },
      "class_type": "KSampler",
      "inputs": {
        "cfg": "4.5",
        "denoise": "0.75",
        "latent_image": ["8", 0],
        "model": ["10", 0],
        "negative": ["12", 0],
        "positive": ["11", 0],
        "sampler_name": "dpmpp_2m",
        "scheduler": "karras",
        "seed": "1234567890123",
        "steps": "28"
      }
    },
    "14": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "VAE Decode"
      },
      "class_type": "VAEDecode",
      "inputs": {
        "samples": ["13", 0],
        "vae": ["4", 0]
      }
    },
    "15": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Save Image"
      },
      "class_type": "SaveImage",
      "inputs": {
        "filename_prefix": "ComfyChair",
        "images": ["14", 0]
      }
    },
    "2": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Identity Edit LoRA"
      },
      "class_type": "LoraLoaderModelOnly",
      "inputs": {
        "lora_name": "mandatory_lora.safetensors",
        "model": ["100", 0],
        "strength_model": 1
      }
    },
    "3": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Load CLIP"
      },
      "class_type": "CLIPLoader",
      "inputs": {
        "clip_name": "clip.safetensors",
        "device": "default",
        "type": "krea2"
      }
    },
    "4": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Load VAE"
      },
      "class_type": "VAELoader",
      "inputs": {
        "vae_name": "vae.safetensors"
      }
    },
    "5": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Source Image"
      },
      "class_type": "LoadImage",
      "inputs": {
        "image": "source_upload.png [input]"
      }
    },
    "6": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Scale to Megapixels"
      },
      "class_type": "ImageScaleToTotalPixels",
      "inputs": {
        "image": ["5", 0],
        "megapixels": "1.5",
        "resolution_steps": 16,
        "upscale_method": "lanczos"
      }
    },
    "7": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Get Image Size"
      },
      "class_type": "GetImageSize",
      "inputs": {
        "image": ["6", 0]
      }
    },
    "8": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Empty Latent Image"
      },
      "class_type": "EmptySD3LatentImage",
      "inputs": {
        "batch_size": "2",
        "height": ["7", 1],
        "width": ["7", 0]
      }
    },
    "9": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "VAE Encode Source"
      },
      "class_type": "VAEEncode",
      "inputs": {
        "pixels": ["6", 0],
        "vae": ["4", 0]
      }
    }
  },
  "notes": [{
    "content": "### Recommended UNET Model\n\nUse **Krea-2 Turbo FP8 scaled** (10 steps, CFG 1).\n\nRemovals and other edits that delete salient content work better with **Krea-2 Raw** at about 40 steps and CFG 3-4.",
    "id": 1,
    "title": "Diffusion Model Selection"
  }, {
    "content": "### Required LoRA\n\nSelect **krea2_identity_edit_v1_2** at strength 1.0. The editing nodes were trained together with this LoRA.\n\nThis workflow needs the **comfyui-krea2edit** custom nodes (github.com/lbouaraba/comfyui-krea2edit); the LoRA is at huggingface.co/conradlocke/krea2-identity-edit.",
    "id": 2,
    "title": "Identity Edit LoRA"
  }, {
    "content": "### Recommended CLIP Model\n\nUse **Qwen 3 VL 4B FP8 scaled**. It also sees the source image while reading the instruction.",
    "id": 3,
    "title": "CLIP Model Selection"
  }, {
    "content": "### Recommended VAE\n\nUse **Qwen Image** VAE for optimal results with Krea-2.",
    "id": 4,
    "title": "VAE Selection"
  }, {
    "content": "### Edit Settings\n\n- **ref_boost** (Edit Model Patch): how closely the result follows the source. 4 = strong likeness (default), 1 = classic behaviour, above 10 removals start failing.\n- **grounding_px** (Edit Instruction): how large the model sees the source while reading the instruction. Lower it if compositions come out doubled.\n\nWrite the edit as a plain instruction, e.g. *Change her outfit to a red raincoat.*",
    "id": 5,
    "title": "Edit Settings"
  }, {
    "content": "### Recommended Settings\n\n- **Steps:** 10 (8 for stronger instruction adherence, 12 for more face detail)\n- **CFG:** 1.0\n- **Megapixels:** 1.0; stay at or below 2\n\n---\n\n*The output keeps the aspect ratio of the source image.*",
    "id": 6,
    "title": "Sampler Settings"
  }]
}
